    "title": "fix: eight porting defects found by running the PC/SC examples on hardware",
    "user": {
      "login": "jeanpierrefortune",
      "id": 1011563,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTE1NjM=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1011563?v=4",
